{"mode":"words","text":"Ahora escucha el texto y léelo al mismo tiempo. Si eres principiante, lee la línea de significado en tu lengua materna, escucha el idioma de destino a un ritmo lento y pulsa a menudo el botón de pausa; así, tu mente asociará el sonido con el significado. Si eres un usuario avanzado, lee el texto original y solo echa un vistazo rápido hacia abajo cuando encuentres palabras que no conozcas. Aprovecha a menudo la repetición A-B: selecciona una sola frase y repítela en bucle; pruébalo más arriba.","words":[{"s":0,"e":360},{"s":406,"e":836},{"s":929,"e":1091},{"s":1161,"e":1637},{"s":1811,"e":1939},{"s":2032,"e":2357},{"s":2438,"e":2566},{"s":2624,"e":2891},{"s":2937,"e":3518},{"s":4122,"e":4249},{"s":4284,"e":4458},{"s":4505,"e":5399},{"s":5909,"e":6130},{"s":6188,"e":6304},{"s":6362,"e":6687},{"s":6745,"e":6815},{"s":6861,"e":7593},{"s":7628,"e":7674},{"s":7744,"e":7848},{"s":7906,"e":8173},{"s":8220,"e":8824},{"s":9149,"e":9613},{"s":9636,"e":9694},{"s":9752,"e":10124},{"s":10170,"e":10240},{"s":10298,"e":10797},{"s":10878,"e":10913},{"s":11006,"e":11087},{"s":11157,"e":11505},{"s":11575,"e":12028},{"s":12237,"e":12353},{"s":12434,"e":12840},{"s":12863,"e":12887},{"s":12933,"e":13316},{"s":13351,"e":13409},{"s":13456,"e":13723},{"s":13781,"e":13839},{"s":13897,"e":14524},{"s":15035,"e":15650},{"s":15894,"e":16021},{"s":16079,"e":16335},{"s":16370,"e":16892},{"s":16962,"e":17043},{"s":17113,"e":17542},{"s":17600,"e":17751},{"s":17809,"e":17879},{"s":17925,"e":18924},{"s":19435,"e":19586},{"s":19620,"e":19818},{"s":19887,"e":19946},{"s":20004,"e":20352},{"s":20398,"e":21211},{"s":21536,"e":21733},{"s":21792,"e":21954},{"s":22024,"e":22291},{"s":22314,"e":22848},{"s":23545,"e":23719},{"s":23788,"e":24044},{"s":24114,"e":24288},{"s":24346,"e":24404},{"s":24439,"e":24845},{"s":24926,"e":25298},{"s":25333,"e":25542},{"s":25588,"e":26041},{"s":26285,"e":26563},{"s":26586,"e":27028},{"s":27086,"e":27527},{"s":27573,"e":27655},{"s":27736,"e":27817},{"s"